title: "Coral Shading Protocol"
version: "5.2.0"
date-released: "2026-11-22"
url: "https://grahamhp.github.io/coral-shading-protocol/"
authors:
  - family-names: Patterson
    given-names: Graham
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/grahamhp/coral-shading-protocol"
abstract: >-
  Design tool for shading corals during heat stress: sizes a shade cloth or an opaque canopy and computes the
  light corals receive under it, point by point, from hourly surface light and radiative-transfer tables for
  the site's water.
keywords:
  - coral reefs
  - coral bleaching
  - shading
  - underwater light
  - radiative transfer
